### 3.1 Typst (v0.15.1, https://github.com/typst/typst, Apache-2.0)

Typst is not embedded in the DataFolio Go binary. When invoked via
`datafolio doctor --install-typst`, DataFolio downloads an official Typst
release archive from https://github.com/typst/typst/releases and verifies its
SHA-256 digest before installing it into the user cache directory.
